 is the library. The book you want is ready. Please come before five today.","questions":[{"question":"Who is calling?","options":["A shop","The library","A school","A friend"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"'this is the library'."},{"question":"By when should you come?","options":["Before three","Before five","Before seven","Tomorrow"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"'before five today'."}]},{"transcript":"Good morning, class. Today we will read a story and then draw a picture. Please open your books.","questions":[{"question":"What will the class do first?","options":["Draw","Read a story","Sing","Play"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"'read a story and then draw'."},{"question":"Who is speaking?","options":["A doctor","A teacher","A driver","A cook"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"מדבר ל-'class' ומבקש לפתוח ספרים."}]},{"transcript":"Hi Mum, I'm at the bus stop. The bus is late. I will be home at six. See you soon!","questions":[{"question":"Where is the speaker?","options":["At home","At the bus stop","At school","At work"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"'I'm at the bus stop'."},{"question":"When will they be home?","options":["At five","At six","At seven","At eight"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"'home at six'."}]}]